  <item>
    <title>夏天的奇幻之旅来啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64ca1f06b3f6c440a8b31395</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64ca1f06b3f6c440a8b31395</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 02 Aug 2023 09:16:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>暑假属于夏天，提到夏天必想到暑假，属于夏天的记忆有好多，三位主播也拿出了压箱底的“夏日奇幻故事”，有人在囧途的体验，也有旅行带来的美好回忆，这期节目里，是不是也会勾起你的回忆？一起来“怀旧”那年夏天吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳一戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 在暑假追过什么选秀节目？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> 那年夏天关于摩洛哥的奇幻故事从这里开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 选择挑战非洲之行的理由是？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a>大爆料！从旅行伙伴聊到主播八卦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 人在“非”囧，差点丢失在非洲的旅行小插曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">08:36</a> 细数这趟旅行中让人直呼人间值得的时刻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 我们因为一趟旅行，从旅行伴侣发展成了...最好的朋友！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 遇见风情万种的房东太太，这趟旅行让人难以忘怀~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> 旅行前必做攻略—了解当地风俗民情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> 从非洲带回的除了记忆还有给小伙伴的伴手礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="934">15:34</a> 夏天的追星记忆开始泛滥…</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇：资深到不能资深的媒体从业人员</span></p><span></span><p><span>joyce：一直在辞职路上的前女主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>小颖：在drama和稳重之间反复横跳的女生</span></p>]]></description>
