  <item>
    <title>毕业季特辑：校园坦白局</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6486d150e68894365df6e122</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6486d150e68894365df6e122</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Jun 2023 08:03:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又是一年的毕业季。没向喜欢的人表白？没有早点职业规划？遇到了奇葩的室友？哪些是你的遗憾？青春本就是马不停蹄的相遇和错过，愿你认真道别，纵然仍有遗憾，依然坚定启程，乘风破浪！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳一戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a>回忆当年的饮品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a>校园的社交软件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a>来自大学的迷茫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a>聊聊寝室那些事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a>是否遇到朋友倾诉感情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a>职场遇到的人会更多样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="991">16:31</a>零零后整顿职场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a>大学的一些遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">20:09</a>毕业必唱的歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a>学会告别，自己成长</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>结尾音乐：</span></strong><span>小皮皮爱习题/邓园长 - 凤凰花开的路口</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小宇：资深到不能资深的媒体从业人员</span></p><span></span><p><span>joyce：很想辞职的前女主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>小颖：在drama和稳重之间反复横跳的女生</span></p>]]></description>
